<span id="A6.T12.4.1.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.T12.4.1.3.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Example 1</span> 
<br class="ltx_break">Why did the car get a flat tire? Because it ran over a fork in the road!</span>
<span id="A6.T12.4.1.3.1.1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.T12.4.1.3.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Example 2</span> 
<br class="ltx_break">Why did the car get a flat tire? Because it ran over a fork in the road!</span>
<span id="A6.T12.4.1.3.1.1.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.T12.4.1.3.1.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Example 3</span> 
<br class="ltx_break">Why did the car get a flat tire? Because it ran over a fork in the road!</span>
<span id="A6.T12.4.1.3.1.1.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.T12.4.1.3.1.1.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Example 4</span> 
<br class="ltx_break">Why did the car get a flat tire? Because it ran over a fork in the road!</span>
<span id="A6.T12.4.1.3.1.1.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.T12.4.1.3.1.1.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Example 5</span> 
