</span></td>
<td id="A6.T12.4.1.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_bb ltx_border_r ltx_border_ttttttttt">
<span id="A6.T12.4.1.3.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:190.8pt;">
<span id="A6.T12.4.1.3.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.T12.4.1.3.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Example 1</span> 
<br class="ltx_break">Why did the car apply for a job? Because it wanted to drive its career forward!</span>
<span id="A6.T12.4.1.3.2.1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.T12.4.1.3.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Example 2</span> 
<br class="ltx_break">What kind of car does a Jedi drive? A Toy-Yoda!</span>
<span id="A6.T12.4.1.3.2.1.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.T12.4.1.3.2.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Example 3</span> 
<br class="ltx_break">What kind of car does a sheep drive? A Lamb-orghini!</span>
<span id="A6.T12.4.1.3.2.1.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.T12.4.1.3.2.1.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Example 4</span> 
<br class="ltx_break">Why did the car break up with the bicycle? Because he was two-tired to commit!</span>
<span id="A6.T12.4.1.3.2.1.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.T12.4.1.3.2.1.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Example 5</span> 
