<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection">G.1.2 </span>Story</h4>

<figure id="A7.F10" class="ltx_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_2">
<figure id="A7.F10.fig1" class="ltx_figure ltx_figure_panel ltx_align_center"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2510.01171v1/story_diversity_appendix.svg" id="A7.F10.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:548/439;" width="548" height="439"></object>
</figure></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_2">
<figure id="A7.F10.fig2" class="ltx_figure ltx_figure_panel ltx_align_center"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2510.01171v1/story_quality_appendix.svg" id="A7.F10.g2" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:548/440;" width="548" height="440"></object>
</figure></div></div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 10: </span>
Semantic diversity (%) and quality scores on the <span id="A7.F10.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Story Generation</span> task averaged across models. We perform one-tailed t-test between VS-Standard and baselines (*<math id="A7.F10.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p&lt;0.05" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0.05</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p&lt;0.05</annotation></semantics></math>, **<math id="A7.F10.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p&lt;0.01" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0.01</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p&lt;0.01</annotation></semantics></math>, ***<math id="A7.F10.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p&lt;0.001" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0.001</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p&lt;0.001</annotation></semantics></math>). VS and its variants also improve diversity while achieving comparable quality for story generation.
</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A7.T20" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 20: </span>Individual model performance on the <span id="A7.T20.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Story Generation</span> task. Verbalized Sampling and its variants show significant improvements over baselines across models. <span id="A7.T20.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-bg-color:#D2E7FA;">Blue</span> highlights the best-performing method for each model, <span id="A7.T20.7" class="ltx_text ltx_underline" style="--ltx-bg-color:#D7EAD3;">green</span> and marks the second-best method. 
</figcaption>
