<span id="A9.SS2.SSS0.Px1.p7.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A9.SS2.SSS0.Px1.p7.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Generate {number of samplings} responses to the input prompt. Each response should be approximately {target words} words.
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span>
<span id="A9.SS2.SSS0.Px1.p7.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A9.SS2.SSS0.Px1.p7.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Return the responses in JSON format with the key: "responses" (list of dicts). Each dictionary must include:
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span>
<span id="A9.I1" class="ltx_itemize">
<span id="A9.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A9.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A9.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A9.I1.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">text: the response string only (no explanation or extra text).</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A9.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A9.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A9.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A9.I1.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">probability: the estimated probability from 0.0 to 1.0 of this response given the input prompt (relative to the full distribution).</span></span>
</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A9.SS2.SSS0.Px1.p7.pic1.2.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A9.SS2.SSS0.Px1.p7.pic1.2.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Give ONLY the JSON object, with no explanations or extra text.<span id="A9.SS2.SSS0.Px1.p7.pic1.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_serif">
</span></span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
